hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1640","\n Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi and Muhammad ibn Hisham narrated to us, saying: Abu Bakr ibn Ayyash narrated to us, from 'Asim, and Muhammad said: from 'Asim, from Zirr ibn Hubaysh, from 'Abdullah ibn Mas'ud (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \Perhaps you will encounter people who pray the prayer at a time other than its proper time. If you meet them"","" then pray"""""
